# =============================================================
# HarvestStat Pipeline — .gitignore
#
# What IS committed:
#   pipeline/        all pipeline scripts + config
#   code/            India analysis notebooks
#   data/processed/  computed CSVs (not large binary files)
#   figures/         output maps (PNGs)
#   results/         model output parquets
#   model_cache/     parquet cache
#   *.py             root-level scripts
#
# What is NOT committed and why:
#   source data files are too large (2.5 GB+ each) or contain
#   proprietary FEWS yield data. Run stablebound to regenerate
#   the boundary outputs; download GOSIF, CROPGRIDs, and India
#   NetCDFs from their original sources (see PROGRESS_LOG.md).
# =============================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Large source data archives
# ------------------------------------------------------------
Monthly.tar
CROPGRIDSv1.08_NC_maps.zip
stablebound_TH_BD_VN_starter.zip

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# stablebound_starter/ — excluded because it contains
# proprietary FEWS yield CSVs and large per-year boundary
# GeoJSONs (~800 MB total). Run stablebound locally to
# regenerate the _out/stable/ outputs the pipeline reads.
# The bug-fixed scripts (prepare_stats.py, build_stable_crops.py)
# are documented in pipeline/PROGRESS_LOG.md Section 1.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
stablebound_starter/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# CROPGRIDs NetCDF files (~63 MB each, many crops)
# Download from figshare: CROPGRIDSv1.08_NC_maps.zip
# ------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/cropgrids/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Large NetCDF files — India climate/SIF source data
# and processed GOSIF country extracts
# ------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/*.nc
data/processed/*.nc

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Binary spatial files regenerated during processing
# ------------------------------------------------------------
data/processed/*.gpkg

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Python cache — never commit these
# ------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
dist/
build/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Virtual environments
# ------------------------------------------------------------
venv/
.venv/
env/
stablebound_env/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Claude Code session files — not project code
# ------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
MEMORY.md
memory_hook.py

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# OS noise
# ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Jupyter checkpoints
# ------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor temp files
# ------------------------------------------------------------
*.swp
*.swo
*~
